    rdfs:label "Evidence for Rye meal used in Leather Tanning, Tawing & Currying: Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (2nd ed., 1840; Project Gutenberg #44562), s.v. LEATHER"@en ;
